.TH CTF-HUNTER 1 "September 2026" "CTF Hunter 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ctf-hunter \- open the CTF Hunter desktop application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ctf-hunter
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ctf-hunter
opens the native desktop interface for inspecting sessions, sources, findings,
decoding paths, capture health, and notification settings.
.PP
The application connects to the per-user
.B ctf-hunterd
Unix socket. Closing the window does not stop the daemon or the privileged
capture helper.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CTF_HUNTER_SOCKET
Override the per-user daemon socket path. Normally the socket is
.IR $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/ctf-hunter/daemon.sock .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/ctf-hunter/hunter.db
Default per-user findings and session database.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ctf-hunterd (1),
.BR ctf-hunterctl (1),
.BR ctf-hunter-capture (1)
